# Godot
#
# ⚠️ `.godot/` is the only generated Godot data that should be ignored. `*.import` and
# `*.uid` are DELIBERATELY NOT ignored (2026-08-15): they carry the stable `uid://`
# identifiers that `.tscn` files reference — 51 resource refs and 36 script refs across
# the scenes here. If they are not committed, a fresh clone re-imports and generates NEW
# uids, so every one of those references misses and Godot falls back to the text path
# with a warning. They are portable: every path inside them is `res://`-relative and the
# cache filename is derived from the source path, so they are identical on any machine.
# This matches Godot 4's own recommended .gitignore, which ignores `.godot/` and nothing else.
.godot/
export_presets.cfg

# Blender
*.blend1
*.blend2

ARTICLE.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Secrets — all .env variants (.env.local, .env.backup, ...) except the template
.env*
!.env.example

# Godot export / build artifacts (export_presets.cfg above can hold signing credentials)
build/
export/
*.app
*.dmg
*.pck

Game_Demo.mov

generate_sounds.ipynb
generate_sounds.py

Game_Demo_final.mp4

# Claude Code local settings (personal permissions, not for the shared repo)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Logs
*.log

# Draft textures (local working copies — .gitkeep preserves folder structure)
game/assets/textures/*/draft/*.png
game/assets/textures/*/draft/*.jpg
game/assets/textures/*/draft/*.jpeg

# macOS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

